      "metaDescription": "Roof heat damage in Kennewick shows up sooner than most homeowners expect. Here's what causes it, what to watch for, and when to call a roofer.",
      "excerpt": "Roof heat damage in Kennewick shows up sooner than most homeowners expect. Here's what causes it, what to watch for, and when to call a roofer.",
      "date": "August 2026",
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-07T12:00:00-05:00",
