      "metaTitle": "Roofing in Yakima, WA: A Homeowner's Guide",
      "metaDescription": "Yakima's high-desert climate shortens roof life faster than most homeowners expect. Here's what to know before hiring a roofing contractor in Yakima, WA.",
      "excerpt": "Yakima's high-desert climate shortens roof life faster than most homeowners expect. Here's what to know before hiring a roofing contractor in Yakima, WA.",
